      "content": "i get what u mean about the doctor but i really don't have the money to go to a clinic right now and its driving me crazy. if i'm really careful and use a brand new needle that i've boiled in water and then cleaned with alcohol, is it really that much riskier? i feel like if i just drain the pressure, it'll heal way faster on its own. it doesn't even look that deep, just like a surface thing.",
